Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃猫是也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽这么说有点自傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但吾确实以身为能干猫而自傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 吾仍然有个烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吾的饲主是个…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:43.90,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,700)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1624,756)}饲主(27岁 女性)上班族
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,连垃圾分类都学不会的人类是也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.07,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}笨蛋 金鱼脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可燃垃圾里塞了塑料垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,专门放塑料垃圾的垃圾桶里放的是宝特瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:01:02.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1550.86,406.29)}丢垃圾前帮忙重新分类的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an3}智人?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就连附近的乌鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都能正确掌握收垃圾的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:15.76,Default,,50,0,185,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&0000FF&}可燃垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:15.76,Default,,1350,0,190,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&000000&}塑料类垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.75,Default,,0,1250,185,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&FF0000&}宝特瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有公司敢雇用如此废的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,若她被解雇…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吾只能立刻抛弃她另寻他处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你改变了汉堡排酱汁的作法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是天才 超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要再做给我吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好幸福喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:37.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,422.29)}能干猫很能照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,电车即将进入第二月台…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托谕吉这件事 可能有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 还是拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请你教我做料理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经穿好围裙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也做好各项准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老师拜托你拜托你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的拿手料理只有煮泡面的话人生就完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上周我才发现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有谕吉在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是个无法好好照顾自己的废柴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.29,注释,,850,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\blur1\3c&FFFFFFFF&\1c&000000&}上周的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(320,430.67)}想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我在公司里却渐渐被认为是个很会做料理的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽小姐会做点心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.21,0:05:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真有女性魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得福泽每天都带便当
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妳会成为贤慧的妻子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我…完全不会做菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽小姐这样都不会做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈 请务必嫁给我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在被发现我的真面目之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能慢慢矫正这个人设…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是 自己的便当自己做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}连猴子都会做的家庭料理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不过不过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望从超简单的料理开始学起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}饭团 简单的TKG
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.06,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\pos(490.67,519.33)\bord0\1c&000000&}简单的生鸡蛋拌饭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有点难耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这道要打蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就是打蛋嘛 我会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.17,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我拿好蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1592,340.66)}打蛋 把蛋倒在饭上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1592,340.66)}再淋一圈酱油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1609.33,340.66)}撒些佐料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,顺序一只有这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,打蛋的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪算猴子也会做的生鸡蛋拌饭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs60\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1583.81,400.85)}打蛋 把蛋倒在饭上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋壳就像佐料一样撒在饭上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以补充钙质…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 蛋壳对猴子来说有没有什么危险的细菌啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手好会拿筷子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的TKG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fn方正稚艺_GBK\blur2\3c&FFFFFF&\1c&000000&\pos(961.33,820.67)}就只是生鸡蛋拌饭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒 是真正的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:30.86,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs70}拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是除了泡面以外的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:30.88,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&000000&\move(457.34,650,457.34,890,0,1000)}看着可悲生物的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:44.00,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}倒光…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有更简单的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不用打蛋 也不用倒酱油的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 我们家有这本食谱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得我有这本书
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:21.04,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}汉堡排
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉不用看食谱就会做料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 这本食谱上的料理…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像…曾经看过…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这些全都是谕吉还是幼猫时做给我吃的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 这有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你的手艺进步神速
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我都忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你边看食谱 边一一做给我吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃好久没吃的这道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉刚开始做给我吃的饭团
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手手能捏出三角形饭团耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么捏的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,做失败的生鸡蛋拌饭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,之后 被谕吉做成了鸡蛋粥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,手机里的贪睡功能 要怎么关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.78,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(156,436.66)}混到卫生纸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:47.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(616,589.99)}毛巾要用力甩够后再晾\N如此绒毛才会蓬松根根分明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.42,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs100\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(164,540.66)}清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.57,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs100\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(1493.33,565.99)}重洗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.96,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(253.33,677.99)}肉泥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.96,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(1682.67,276.66)}账本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.97,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(577.33,452.66)}看着余额来安定身心的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,此时此刻 外面正下着一场与气象预报大相径庭的豪雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这场豪雨 预计会持续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,夜半时分 雨会越下越大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,需预防土石流来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思百忙之中打扰您
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,您现在撑的折叠伞 经常带在身边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 因为太常去便利商店买伞 回家会被骂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有人要我随身带着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,家里便利商店的伞真的会越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还好有人提醒您随身携带折叠伞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊 我很感谢它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,雨越来越大了 回去时请小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思谢谢您愿意受访
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来 是深受大家喜爱的单元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 今天的菜色太豪华了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来超好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么好事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可以喝高级啤酒大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明天还会下雨啰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,早上的雨好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还好有带折叠伞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了个好东西喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}木天蓼 木枝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:11.42,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\an8}嗨翻天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(392,380.66)}这是木天蓼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的拿法 拿法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-早安 -早
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在时间快早上六点五十分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的天气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全国都是好天气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:52.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}七点前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是个适合晾衣服的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请多加利用今天的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs70\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(788,880.66)}万年睡过头\N＆赖床惯犯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌 我没有发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是很少这么早起 你很没礼貌耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,体温计是不是坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪有这么…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}"不能请假吗"的气场
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今天…不能请假啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,从早上开始就要开三场会议
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候就是不能因为一点小病而请假休息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我平常嚷着要请假要休息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是有身为社会人士的自觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷好冷…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,部长早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是福泽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:41.22,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}感冒药
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还请多包涵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我请了半天假
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你就别咂嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,得在下午前退烧才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:57.95,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}感冒药
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,流汗 让自己流汗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,吃超辣料理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后泡热呼呼的澡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 不要阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\frz270\fs70\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(426.67,492.66)}单从消耗体力上来说\N就已经是反效果了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我买猫罐罐回来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,之后 我会更努力工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,会买很多猫罐罐喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,请退到黄线后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 现在几点了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去公司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好像…退烧了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像还是有点不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最后还是请了一整天的假
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃能干猫是也
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能干猫很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,海蛞蝓是软体动物门腹足纲裸鳃目中无壳的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,简而言之 是螺类的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一对触觉器官像是角一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因此又被称为海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,海蛞蝓 正是蛞蝓系偶像 UMYU-Sea 的原型
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,时间不够了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能干猫去水族馆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吾很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:42.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}インスタグラムにも載ってない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:45.12,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(274,342.5)}私の奥のこと見せたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(229,286.25)}貴方だけの私に
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:50.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(295,368.75)}なってみたいなりたいなりたいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:53.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(292,365)}朝焼けの眼差しは冷たい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}タバコが染みた服臭い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:58.09,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(215,268.75)}夜が終わってもまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:22:00.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(269,336.25)}どこにも行けない帰さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:01.88,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(110,137.5)}Don't leave me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.55,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(140,175)}Do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:05.97,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(244,305)}We can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:09.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(131,163.75)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(138,172.5)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:14.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(245,306.25)}これは　どうしようもなく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(236,295)}しょーもない恋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:20.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}これもまた　好きになっちゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:23.32,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(278,347.5)}ダメとわかっていても…ってやつです
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(162,202.5)}I know　もうね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:28.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(290,362.5)}年頃ってやつが悪さをしていて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:31.50,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}よくない男に惹かれちゃって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:34.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}もっと　もっとで欲しくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}摂氏0度で燃える青い東京
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:42.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(320,400)}夜の端くれだってそこそこに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:45.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}私とあなたの真ん中で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.13,0:22:47.39,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(224,280)}要らないアイテム消して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:50.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(282,352.5)}冬の花と咲いてみたかったの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:53.23,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(303,378.75)}始発の電車は太陽より
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:56.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}強く私はずかしめる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:58.77,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(273,341.25)}もうこれ以上朝にならないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:02.61,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(100,403.75)}永遠に昨日で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:07.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}たった一つだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(371,463.75)}君だけがいればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:18.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(705,881.25)}今日も明日も全てが　煌めいてゆく毎日が宝物です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}ありきたりで単純に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.76,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(359,448.75)}人並みでいるはずだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:38.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(382,477.5)}当たり前を夢見ては
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.85,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(344,430)}器用に生きて損をする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:45.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(340,425)}そんな時代です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:49.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}こんな世の中です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:54.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(437,546.25)}空っぽな心を振り回しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:59.28,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(473,591.25)}生きる意味はあるかい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:04.79,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(383,478.75)}何もいらない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(367,458.75)}君だけが愛おしい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.67,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(249,311.25)}気づけばそこにある拾い上げた
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(417,521.25)}ときめきがキラキラ羽ばたく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:21.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}こんな日常が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:24.56,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(348,435)}続けばいいなんて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(161,201.25)}自分に素直なことが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:32.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(528,660)}幸せへの近道にきっとなるから
